  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p>Zanzibar's climate is tropical year-round, but the best time to visit depends on your preferences:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Dry season (June–October):</strong> Ideal for sunshine, beach activities, and diving. Little rainfall.</li>
        <li><strong>Short dry spell (December–February):</strong> Warm and sunny, great for swimming and water sports.</li>
        <li><strong>Long rains (April–May):</strong> Heavy showers may disrupt tours and ferries.</li>
        <li><strong>Short rains (November):</strong> Occasionally unpredictable but still usable.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For the best experience, target the dry months when you can enjoy full-day excursions, beach time, and marine activities without weather interruptions.</p>
    </div>
